# Build context of images built from the repository root: only the tools' image (infra/knative/Dockerfile.mcp)
# is, and it needs only the tool code. (The runner image builds from its own staging folder, infra/cloud/.build.)
*
!pulse/__init__.py
!pulse/paths.py
!pulse/agent/__init__.py
!pulse/agent/mcp_server.py
!pulse/agent/tau_airline/
!pulse/agent/tau_retail/
**/__pycache__
